  <process id="Id_9bfac0d1-0795-4e28-ae87-042e3791c12c" name="Processo de Obras Públicas - FNDE/MEC e Municípios - SP3. ETP">
    <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133/2021 - Art. 6&amp;ordm; Para os fins desta Lei, consideram-se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XX - estudo t&amp;eacute;cnico preliminar: documento constitutivo da primeira etapa do planejamento de uma contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;oque caracteriza o interesse p&amp;uacute;blico envolvido e a sua melhor solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e d&amp;aacute; base ao anteprojeto, ao termo de refer&amp;ecirc;nciaou ao projeto b&amp;aacute;sico a serem elaborados caso se conclua pela viabilidade da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 18. A fase preparat&amp;oacute;ria do processo licitat&amp;oacute;rio &amp;eacute; caracterizada pelo planejamento e deve compatibilizar-se com o plano de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es anual de que trata o inciso VII do &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;caput &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;do art. 12 desta Lei, sempre que elaborado, e com as leis or&amp;ccedil;ament&amp;aacute;rias, bem como abordar todas as considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es t&amp;eacute;cnicas, mercadol&amp;oacute;gicas e de gest&amp;atilde;o que podem interferir na contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, compreendidos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;I - a descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da necessidade da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o fundamentada em estudo t&amp;eacute;cnico preliminar que caracterize o interesse p&amp;uacute;blico envolvido;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 1&amp;ordm; O estudo t&amp;eacute;cnico preliminar a que se refere o inciso I do &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;caput &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;deste artigo dever&amp;aacute; evidenciar o problema aser resolvido e a sua melhor solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, de modo a permitir a avalia&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da viabilidade t&amp;eacute;cnica e econ&amp;ocirc;mica dacontrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, e conter&amp;aacute; os seguintes elementos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;I - descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da necessidade da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, considerado o problema a ser resolvido sob a perspectiva dointeresse p&amp;uacute;blico;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;II - demonstra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da previs&amp;atilde;o da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o no plano de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es anual, sempre que elaborado, de modoa indicar o seu alinhamento com o planejamento da Administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;III - requisitos da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;IV - estimativas das quantidades para a contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, acompanhadas das mem&amp;oacute;rias de c&amp;aacute;lculo e dosdocumentos que lhes d&amp;atilde;o suporte, que considerem interdepend&amp;ecirc;ncias com outras contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, de modo a possibilitareconomia de escala;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;V - levantamento de mercado, que consiste na an&amp;aacute;lise das alternativas poss&amp;iacute;veis, e justificativa t&amp;eacute;cnica eecon&amp;ocirc;mica da escolha do tipo de solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o a contratar;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VI - estimativa do valor da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, acompanhada dos pre&amp;ccedil;os unit&amp;aacute;rios referenciais, das mem&amp;oacute;rias dec&amp;aacute;lculo e dos documentos que lhe d&amp;atilde;o suporte, que poder&amp;atilde;o constar de anexo classificado, se a Administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o optarpor preservar o seu sigilo at&amp;eacute; a conclus&amp;atilde;o da licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VII - descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o como um todo, inclusive das exig&amp;ecirc;ncias relacionadas &amp;agrave; manuten&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e &amp;agrave; assist&amp;ecirc;nciat&amp;eacute;cnica, quando for o caso;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VIII - justificativas para o parcelamento ou n&amp;atilde;o da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;IX - demonstrativo dos resultados pretendidos em termos de economicidade e de melhor aproveitamento dosrecursos humanos, materiais e financeiros dispon&amp;iacute;veis;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;X - provid&amp;ecirc;ncias a serem adotadas pela Administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o previamente &amp;agrave; celebra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do contrato, inclusive quanto &amp;agrave;capacita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de servidores ou de empregados para fiscaliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e gest&amp;atilde;o contratual;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XI - contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es correlatas e/ou interdependentes;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XII - descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de poss&amp;iacute;veis impactos ambientais e respectivas medidas mitigadoras, inclu&amp;iacute;dos requisitos debaixo consumo de energia e de outros recursos, bem como log&amp;iacute;stica reversa para desfazimento e reciclagem de bense refugos, quando aplic&amp;aacute;vel;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XIII - posicionamento conclusivo sobre a adequa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para o atendimento da necessidade a quese destina.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 2&amp;ordm; O estudo t&amp;eacute;cnico preliminar dever&amp;aacute; conter ao menos os elementos previstos nos incisos I, IV, VI, VIII e XIII do &amp;sect; 1&amp;ordm; deste artigo e, quando n&amp;atilde;o contemplar os demais elementos previstos no referido par&amp;aacute;grafo, apresentar as devidas justificativas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 3&amp;ordm; Em se tratando de estudo t&amp;eacute;cnico preliminar para contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de obras e servi&amp;ccedil;os comuns de engenharia, se demonstrada a inexist&amp;ecirc;ncia de preju&amp;iacute;zo para a aferi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dos padr&amp;otilde;es de desempenho e qualidade almejados, a especifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do objeto poder&amp;aacute; ser realizada apenas em termo de refer&amp;ecirc;ncia ou em projeto b&amp;aacute;sico, dispensada a elabora&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de projetos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
